# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project data policy
#   raw/      : source corpus downloaded by `src.corpus.acquire`. The .raw files
#               (~15 MB total) ARE tracked so a fresh checkout runs without any
#               download; arrow shards and HF caches are not. Provenance
#               (SOURCE.md, CHECKSUMS.sha256) is tracked too.
#   derived/  : regenerated by phase1.ipynb, but deterministic — tracked so a
#               grader sees the slice, checksum, manifest, and baseline without
#               running anything. Re-running produces byte-identical files.
#   evidence/ : graded artifacts — tracked.
#   docs/     : data cards + report material — tracked (some generated).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw corpus downloads. The .raw files are committed (see data policy above);
# arrow shards and datasets caches are regenerable and stay out of git.
raw/wikitext-2/*.arrow
raw/wikitext-2/cache-*/

# Tokenizer vocab dumped as a fallback by src.tokenizer.datacard
docs/vocab.txt

# Hugging Face / datasets local caches, if ever pointed at the project
hf_cache/
.huggingface/
